%% Drel push delivery sequence
%% Source of truth: docs/diagrams/push-sequence.mmd
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as Your script
    participant R as Relay
    participant A as Apple APNs
    participant I as Drel on iPhone
    participant N as Notification service ext.

    S->>R: GET /<key>/<title>/<body>?url=...
    R->>R: look up the device token in the registry
    R->>R: sign the provider JWT (ES256)
    R->>A: POST over HTTP/2<br/>apns-topic · apns-push-type
    A-->>I: deliver
    Note right of A: 200 means accepted,<br/>not displayed
    I->>N: hand over the payload
    N->>N: decrypt if the envelope is encrypted
    N-->>I: the decrypted payload
    I->>I: record it in the Inbox
